WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.800
You saved it. Then it was gone.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.190
Shoebox. Keep it.

3
00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:07.860
It comes back to you.

4
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.180
Keep anything, from any app. Say why in a few words.

5
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.640
Shoebox reads the day it's about, and brings it back before then.

6
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:32.690
Forward the school newsletter. Shoebox finds the dates that are about your family, and makes each one its own post. They come back before the day.

7
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.110
Flick up for the next one.

8
00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.480
Pull down when you're done.

9
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.780
Tap to open.

10
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.510
Everything you're not done with, in one calm place.

11
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:57.000
It reads on your phone, with Apple Intelligence. Your mail is sealed, so only your phone can open it.

12
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.000
Shoebox for iPhone. Join the beta.
